    "reason": "The revert in [ev-361fb7d5faa3] undoes PR #21064, and both PRs change only the UI YAML editor component ui/src/app/shared/components/yaml-editor/yaml-editor.tsx [ev-4aff389248bc][ev-843cd284d60f]. That makes it a display-only UI fix, not a wire/protocol behaviour, so the protocol-behavior subject is wrong. The regression was reported against a master build [ev-0e6920082e99][ev-088a5858fcca], which suggests the array-splitting was added and reverted during the same development cycle. If so, the release carries no net change an operator could be exposed to. No typed assertion in any subject family follows from this evidence.",
